@ref s 25B(5) (src:4338-4340)
GIVEN `the liability is incurred by the directors, or by any other person, by reason of the directors exceeding their powers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 25B(5) section 25B affects the liability` MEANS
    IF `the liability is incurred by the directors, or by any other person, by reason of the directors exceeding their powers`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section does not affect any liability incurred by the directors, or any other person, by reason of the directors exceeding their powers."
    ELSE NOTHING      -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the saving is of a liability incurred by reason of the directors exceeding their powers; any other liability is outside it

